# Added 2026-05-26 by street-sweeper Phase B (allostatic-relief for INV-13 rejects)
# 2026-08-11: bare `data/` excluded the DIRECTORY, deadening every !data/…
# negation above it AND silently keeping the 44-record experiment-frame
# corpus (batches 1/2/2r primary evidence) out of history — batch-2
# amendment 9. `data/*` (line 15) already ignores unlisted children.
!data/experiment-frames/
!data/experiment-frames/**
!data/pattern-staging/
!data/pattern-staging/**
# 2026-08-13: the CT commissioning artifacts are the pre-registration's
# evidence base — problem text, negative probe, ground truth, run records.
# Leaving them under `data/*` would reproduce instance 13 (the evidence base
# with no past) on the very trial meant to prove the system.
!data/ct-commissioning/
!data/ct-commissioning/**
.shadow-cljs/
tmp/
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log
core.*
*.hprof
.fedtoken
*.bak-*

