# !data/… negations.
logs/data/

# 2026-08-14 (claude-2): apm-driver transient run state. Heartbeats and lane
# logs are written continuously by the driver; the lock is process state.
holes/labs/M-diagramprover/apm-driver/*.log
holes/labs/M-diagramprover/apm-driver/.bridge-lane.lock

# 2026-08-28: append-only run products are live state, not checkout inputs.
#
# These three suffixes cover a new CAMPAIGN's products (foo-ledger.jsonl
# matches) but NOT a new KIND of product: frame-trace.jsonl, solver-rounds.jsonl
# and even the existing ledger.jsonl are not matched, because *-ledger.jsonl
# requires a hyphen prefix. Verified 2026-08-28 with git check-ignore.
#
# This is knowingly a list, and it is the second ignore rule this one directory
# has needed in two weeks (see *.log at 2026-08-14). It was NOT inverted to
# "ignore *.jsonl here, un-ignore the ten tracked corpora", because the two
# failure modes are not equally bad: a rule that under-matches lets a new
# product make the tree dirty, which someone SEES; ignore-by-default would let a
# new input corpus vanish unstaged, which is README-inbox-zero's cost #1
# automated and silent.
#
# The repair that removes the choice is a location convention -- products to
# their own subdirectory, ignored wholesale -- so that a misplaced product shows
# as dirt and a new corpus stays tracked. Both failures visible. Not done here.
holes/labs/**/apm-driver/*-audit.jsonl
holes/labs/**/apm-driver/*-ledger.jsonl
holes/labs/**/apm-driver/*-manifest.jsonl
